---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="SWR drainage | Flowin Pipes & Fittings" description="Explore Flowin SWR ring-fit and self-fit drainage systems, with verified ring-fit pipe tables and the full 2026 catalogue.">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main>
    <div class="wrap product-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">SWR drainage</span></div>
    <section class="wrap range-hero" aria-labelledby="range-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">Product system / 03</span><h1 id="range-title">SWR<br />drainage.</h1></div><div class="range-hero-side"><p>Explore the two SWR joint systems separately, with source-checked pipe, fitting and accessory tables from the 2026 catalogue.</p><a class="text-link" href="/catalogue/flowin-price-list-2026.pdf#page=11" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View SWR catalogue pages <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="wrap range-family-section" aria-labelledby="families-title"><div class="range-section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Explore SWR</span><h2 id="families-title">Choose a system<br />or fitting.</h2><p>Ring-fit and self-fit are distinct catalogue sections. Both pipe families and all ring-fit fitting tables are source-checked.</p></div>
      <div class="family-card-grid">
        <a class="family-card family-card-featured" href="/products/swr/ring-fit-pipes/"><span class="family-number">01 / RING FIT</span><div class="family-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path d="M27 16v88m22-88v88m26-88v88m20-88v88M20 16h36M20 104h36M68 16h34M68 104h34M27 32h22M75 32h20" /></svg></div><div><h3>Ring-fit pipes</h3><p>Six lengths, 75 and 110 mm, with single- and double-socket rates.</p><span class="family-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="family-card" href="/products/swr/self-fit-pipes/"><span class="family-number">02 / SELF FIT</span><div class="family-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path d="M28 16v88m20-88v88m27-88v88m18-88v88M22 16h32M22 104h32M68 16h32M68 104h32M25 37h26M72 37h24" /></svg></div><div><h3>Self-fit pipes</h3><p>Single-socket Type A in 3 m and 6 m lengths, with 75 and 110 mm rates.</p><span class="family-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="family-card" href="/products/swr/ring-fit-bends/"><span class="family-number">03 / RING FIT</span><div class="family-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path d="M20 32h40v24c0 18 14 32 32 32h8v22h-8c-30 0-54-24-54-54V54H20zM65 16h34v24c0 14 9 25 21 29" /></svg></div><div><h3>Ring-fit bends</h3><p>87.5-degree bend and door-bend sizes, box packing and rates.</p><span class="family-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="family-card" href="/products/swr/ring-fit-tees/"><span class="family-number">04 / RING FIT</span><div class="family-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path d="M43 15h34v30h28v30H77v30H43V75H15V45h28zM47 22h26M47 98h26M22 49v22" /></svg></div><div><h3>Ring-fit tees</h3><p>Single-tee and door-tee sizes, box packing and rates.</p><span class="family-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="family-card" href="/products/swr/ring-fit-couplers/"><span class="family-number">05 / RING FIT</span><div class="family-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path d="M34 12h52v96H34zM34 21c14 10 38 10 52 0M34 99c14-10 38-10 52 0M34 48h52M34 72h52" /></svg></div><div><h3>Ring-fit couplers</h3><p>75 and 110 mm sizes, box packing and rates.</p><span class="family-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="family-card" href="/products/swr/ring-fit-shoe-bends/"><span class="family-number">06 / RING FIT</span><div class="family-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path d="M18 28h37v28c0 22 18 40 40 40h7v18h-7c-32 0-58-26-58-58V46H18zM23 33c9 7 23 7 30 0M102 85v22" /></svg></div><div><h3>Ring-fit shoe bend</h3><p>45-degree bend in 75 and 110 mm, with box packing and rates.</p><span class="family-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="family-card" href="/products/swr/ring-fit-accessories/"><span class="family-number">07 / RING FIT</span><div class="family-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path d="M38 14h34v31h29v30H72v31H38V75H10V45h28zM42 20h26M42 100h26M14 51h25M76 51h21" /></svg></div><div><h3>More ring-fit fittings</h3><p>Double tees, reducers, cleansing pipes and rubber rings.</p><span class="family-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="family-card" href="/products/swr/self-fit-fittings/"><span class="family-number">08 / SELF FIT</span><div class="family-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path d="M39 13h34v31h30v31H73v32H39V75H10V44h29zM43 19h26M43 101h26M16 50h25M78 50h19" /></svg></div><div><h3>Self-fit fittings</h3><p>Bends, tees, couplers, traps and reducers from page 12.</p><span class="family-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="family-card" href="/products/swr/self-fit-accessories/"><span class="family-number">09 / SELF FIT</span><div class="family-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path d="M40 14h40v28h22v36H80v28H40V78H18V42h22zM44 19h32M44 100h32M24 49h16" /></svg></div><div><h3>Self-fit accessories</h3><p>Cleansing pipes, caps, traps and PVC solvent from page 13.</p><span class="family-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="range-catalogue-band"><div class="wrap range-catalogue-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow">Original source</span><h2>Compare with<br />the catalogue.</h2></div><div><p>The SWR pipe and fitting tables are now available online. Check the original 2026 price list for the printed terms and latest commercial confirmation.</p><a class="solid-btn" href="/catalogue/flowin-price-list-2026.pdf#page=11" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Browse SWR catalogue <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  </main><SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
